WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:12.441
Inventory part mein hum stock sambhaalna
seekhenge.

2
00:00:12.481 --> 00:00:17.852
Stock screen par har medicine ka kul stock, agli
expiry aur rack dikhta hai.

3
00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:24.617
'Low stock only' tick karne par sirf woh
medicines dikhti hain jo reorder level se neeche
hain.

4
00:00:25.361 --> 00:00:28.427
Doosre billing software se aa rahe hain?

5
00:00:28.467 --> 00:00:32.310
Purani stock list Excel ya CSV mein Import
kijiye.

6
00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:36.658
Medoro pehle preview dikhata hai, har row mein
kya hoga,

7
00:00:36.698 --> 00:00:39.842
aur galti ho to kuch bhi save nahi karta.

8
00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:45.945
Yahan teen naye items hain, thermometer, mask
aur sanitizer, unke batch

9
00:00:45.985 --> 00:00:47.989
aur opening stock ke saath.

10
00:00:48.029 --> 00:00:50.865
Import dabaate hi stock jud jaata hai.

11
00:00:51.623 --> 00:00:53.552
Ab batches dekhte hain.

12
00:00:53.592 --> 00:00:58.604
Paracip 650 ke kai batches hain, alag-alag
expiry ke saath.

13
00:00:58.644 --> 00:01:04.340
Billing par Medoro FEFO niyam chalata hai: First
Expiry, First Out,

14
00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:09.306
yaani jo batch sabse pehle expire hoga, wahi
pehle bikega.

15
00:01:10.049 --> 00:01:15.624
Agar koi strip toot-phoot gayi, to 'Correct
stock' mein kaaran chunkar maatra ghataaiye.

16
00:01:15.664 --> 00:01:19.261
Har adjustment ka kaaran aur samay record mein
rehta hai.

17
00:01:20.001 --> 00:01:24.748
Stock count ke liye, shelf par gini hui maatra
Counted mein daaliye

18
00:01:24.788 --> 00:01:26.891
aur 'Save stock count' kijiye.

19
00:01:26.931 --> 00:01:29.320
Farq apne-aap adjust ho jaata hai.

20
00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:34.593
Branch transfer: Kanke Road branch mein ORS kam
pad gaya hai.

21
00:01:34.633 --> 00:01:39.072
Batch chunkar, branch aur maatra bhariye, aur
Send dabaaiye.

22
00:01:39.112 --> 00:01:43.551
Stock yahan se ghatkar doosri branch mein
pahunch jaata hai.

23
00:01:44.297 --> 00:01:49.786
Batch ka status bhi badal sakte hain: OK to
sell, Quarantine, ya Recalled.

24
00:01:49.826 --> 00:01:56.509
Quarantine ya Recalled batch billing mein nahi
bikta, jab tak aap use waapas OK na karein.

25
00:01:57.266 --> 00:02:01.292
Expiry par nazar rakhne ke liye sidebar mein
Expiry prevention

26
00:02:01.332 --> 00:02:05.554
aur Stock intelligence hain, jahan jaldi expire
hone wale batches

27
00:02:05.594 --> 00:02:07.653
aur reorder ki salaah milti hai.

28
00:02:07.693 --> 00:02:11.456
Reorder level har medicine ke edit form mein set
hota hai.
